-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions of seat distributor from part P0 (merged; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- P0-cases-seat-distributor: the cases of the questions in P0-seat-distributor.l4: the facts a person in the seat would state.
-- Every expected value was decided from the text of the Regulation before the file was run and is written beside its assertion with the words that license it;
-- none was copied from the encoding's output. A failing assertion is a finding, never an expectation to edit.
-- Dates the cases stand on: 31 July 2024 (the day before entry into force), 1 August 2024, 1 and 2 February 2025 (Chapter I), 26 and 27 July 2026 (each side of the Omnibus),
-- 1 and 2 August 2026 (the general date), 2 December 2026, 2 August 2027, 2 December 2027, 2 August 2028, 2 August 2030, 31 December 2030, as each function needs.
-- A MIRROR comment marks a case whose facts are asked, with the same answer, in the case file of another seat (the Guide, section 3).
-- A #TRACE is preceded by its -- EXPECT line (FULFILLED, BREACH or OPEN: the obligation still pending). The clock of a trace is the number of days since the day the rule counts from.
-- Assertions: 100. Traces: 6.

§ `Article 1: does Chapter I apply on the date asked?`

-- Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked
-- 1 January 2024, before the Regulation exists: JUST FALSE, the Regulation has not entered into force (Art 113, first paragraph: "on the twentieth day following that of its publication")
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 1 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 31 July 2024, the day before entry into force: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 31 7 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 1 August 2024, in force but Chapter I applies only from 2 February 2025: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 1 February 2025, the day before Chapter I applies (Art 113(a)): JUST FALSE
-- MIRROR Art 113(a): whether Chapter I applies, asked from every seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 2 February 2025, the day Chapter I applies (Art 113(a)): JUST TRUE
-- MIRROR Art 113(a): whether Chapter I applies, asked from every seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, the text as enacted still in force: JUST TRUE (as enacted point (a): "Chapters I and II shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 26 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST TRUE (point (a) as replaced keeps 2 February 2025 for Chapters I and II)
#ASSERT `Under Article 1, as a distributor, does Chapter I apply on the date asked` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE


§ `Article 2(1): does the Regulation apply to me?`

-- Under Article 2(1)(d), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to me
-- 1 February 2025, Chapter I has not begun to apply, so nothing is covered (Art 113(a): Chapters I and II "shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(d), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 1 2 2025) EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025: JUST TRUE ("importers and distributors of AI systems")
-- MIRROR Art 2(1)(d): an importer and a distributor of AI systems
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(d), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 2 2 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST TRUE (limb (d) was not changed)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(d), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 27 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 1 August 2024, in force but Chapter I not yet applying: NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(1)(d), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to me` (Date 1 8 2024) EQUALS NOTHING


§ `Article 2(2): my high-risk AI system under Article 6(1) with Section B products (replaced by the Omnibus)`

-- Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products
-- 1 February 2025, Chapter I has not begun to apply, so nothing is covered (Art 113(a): Chapters I and II "shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 1 2 2025) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 6 "" 1 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 26 July 2026 (text as enacted), Article 6(1) itself: JUST TRUE (as enacted: "only Article 6(1), Articles 102 to 109 and Article 112 apply")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 6 "" 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, the whole of Article 6: NOTHING, because only paragraph 1 of it is named and a reference to the whole Article is mixed
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 6 "" 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 26 July 2026, Article 9: JUST FALSE (as enacted: "only Article 6(1), Articles 102 to 109 and Article 112 apply": Article 9 is not named)
-- MIRROR Art 2(2): the same Article asked from each operator seat about the same high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, Article 110: JUST FALSE (as enacted the list stops at Article 109; Article 110 is not named)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 110 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, Article 57, requirements not integrated: JUST FALSE ("Article 57 applies only in so far as the requirements ... have been integrated")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, Article 57, requirements integrated: JUST TRUE (the "only in so far as" condition is met)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, Article 58, requirements integrated: JUST FALSE (as enacted only Article 57 has the conditional sentence; Article 58 is not named)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 58 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026 (text as amended), Article 6(1) itself: JUST TRUE (as amended: "only Article 6(1), Article 60a and Articles 102 to 112 shall apply")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 6 "" 1 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 60a: JUST TRUE ("Article 60a" is named as amended)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 60 "a" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 110: JUST TRUE (as amended the list runs to Article 112)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 110 "" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 113: JUST FALSE (outside "Articles 102 to 112")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 113 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 9: JUST FALSE (not named as amended)
-- MIRROR Art 2(2): the same Article asked from each operator seat about the same high-risk AI system
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 57, not integrated: JUST FALSE ("Articles 57, 58 and 59 shall apply only in so far as ... integrated")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE FALSE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 57, integrated: JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 57 "" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 58, integrated: JUST TRUE (as amended Article 58 joins the conditional sentence)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` TRUE TRUE 58 "" 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, an AI system high-risk under Article 6(2) and Annex III: NOTHING (the paragraph is for systems classified "in accordance with Article 6(1)")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` TRUE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026, an AI system that is not high-risk: NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` TRUE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026, an Article 6(1) system whose products are not covered by Section B legislation: NOTHING (limited by "related to products covered by ... Section B of Annex I")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` FALSE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS NOTHING
-- 26 July 2026, an Article 6(1) system whose products are not covered by Section B legislation: NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(2), as a distributor, does the provision I name apply to my high-risk AI system with Section B products` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` FALSE FALSE 9 "" 0 EQUALS NOTHING


§ `Article 2(3): areas outside Union law, and military, defence and national security`

-- Under Article 2(3), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system used exclusively for military, defence or national security purposes
-- 1 February 2025, Chapter I has not begun to apply, so nothing is covered (Art 113(a): Chapters I and II "shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(3), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system used exclusively for military, defence or national security purposes` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, exclusively military, defence or national security: JUST FALSE ("This Regulation does not apply to AI systems where and in so far they are placed on the market, put into service, or used ... exclusively for military, defence or national security purposes")
-- MIRROR Art 2(3) second subparagraph: the same military AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(3), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system used exclusively for military, defence or national security purposes` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 2 February 2025, a system with any other purpose too: NOTHING (limited by "exclusively")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(3), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system used exclusively for military, defence or national security purposes` (Date 2 2 2025) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST FALSE (the subparagraph was not changed)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(3), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system used exclusively for military, defence or national security purposes` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Article 2(12): AI systems released under free and open-source licences`

-- Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence
-- 1 February 2025, Chapter I has not begun to apply, so nothing is covered (Art 113(a): Chapters I and II "shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 1 2 2025) TRUE `Route neither` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, open-source, not high-risk, outside Articles 5 and 50: JUST FALSE ("This Regulation does not apply to AI systems released under free and open-source licences")
-- MIRROR Art 2(12): the same open-source AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE `Route neither` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 2 February 2025, high-risk under Article 6(2) and Annex III: NOTHING ("unless they are placed on the market or put into service as high-risk AI systems")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, high-risk under Article 6(1) and Annex I: NOTHING (the same "unless")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, falls under Article 5: NOTHING ("or as an AI system that falls under Article 5")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE `Route neither` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, falls under Article 50: NOTHING ("or 50")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 2 2 2025) TRUE `Route neither` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 2 February 2025, not released under an open-source licence: NOTHING (the exclusion speaks of open-source systems only)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 2 2 2025) FALSE `Route neither` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST FALSE (paragraph 12 was not changed)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(12), as a distributor, does the Regulation apply to the AI system released under a free and open-source licence` (Date 27 7 2026) TRUE `Route neither` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE


§ `Article 2(13): limiting the requirements for Article 6(1) systems (inserted by the Omnibus)`

-- Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited
-- 1 February 2025, Chapter I has not begun to apply, so nothing is covered (Art 113(a): Chapters I and II "shall apply from 2 February 2025")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 1 2 2025) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` 9 "" 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 26 July 2026 (text as enacted), Article 9, both conditions met: NOTHING (paragraph 13 is not in the text as enacted)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` 9 "" 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026 (text as amended), Article 9, both conditions met: JUST TRUE ("may be limited, where and to the extent that: (a) ...; and (b) ...")
-- MIRROR Art 2(13): the same requirement asked from each operator seat that bears Articles 9 to 25
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` 9 "" 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 9, point (b) not met: JUST FALSE (both conditions are needed)
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` 9 "" 0 TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 9, point (a) not met: JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` 9 "" 0 FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Article 16, between the two ranges: NOTHING (limited by "Articles 9 to 15 and 17 to 25")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` 16 "" 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026, Article 17, the first of "17 to 25": JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` 17 "" 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, an AI system high-risk under Article 6(2) and Annex III: NOTHING (limited by "For high-risk AI systems referred to in Article 6(1)")
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` 9 "" 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 27 July 2026, an AI system that is not high-risk: NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under Article 2(13), as a distributor, may the application of the requirement or obligation I name be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` 9 "" 0 TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING


§ `Article 3(3) to (8): does the definition of my role fit me?`

-- Under Article 3(7), as a distributor, does the definition of a distributor fit me
-- in the supply chain, neither provider nor importer, makes it available on the Union market: TRUE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(7), as a distributor, does the definition of a distributor fit me` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- not in the supply chain: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(7), as a distributor, does the definition of a distributor fit me` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- is the provider: FALSE ("other than the provider")
-- MIRROR Art 3(3) and Art 3(7): a party that develops an AI system and places it under its own name is its provider, and so not its distributor
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(7), as a distributor, does the definition of a distributor fit me` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- is the importer: FALSE ("or the importer")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(7), as a distributor, does the definition of a distributor fit me` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- does not make it available on the Union market: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(7), as a distributor, does the definition of a distributor fit me` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

-- Under Article 3(8), as a distributor, am I an operator
-- the seat's role is passed as the keel's `Role`: TRUE ("'operator' means a provider, product manufacturer, deployer, authorised representative, importer or distributor"): the role of this seat is on the list
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(8), as a distributor, am I an operator` EQUALS TRUE


§ `Article 3(9) to (11): placing on the market, making available on the market, putting into service`

-- Under Article 3(10), as a distributor, is my supply a making available on the market
-- a supply for distribution or use on the Union market in the course of a commercial activity: TRUE
-- MIRROR Art 3(10): the same supply asked from the importer and the distributor seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(10), as a distributor, is my supply a making available on the market` TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- not in the course of a commercial activity: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(10), as a distributor, is my supply a making available on the market` TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- not for distribution or use on the Union market: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(10), as a distributor, is my supply a making available on the market` FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 3(23): substantial modification`

-- Under Article 3(23), as a distributor, is the change a substantial modification
-- after placing on the market, not foreseen, compliance affected: TRUE ("a change ... which is not foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment ... as a result of which the compliance ... is affected")
-- MIRROR Art 3(23): the same change asked from the provider, importer, distributor, deployer and notified body seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as a distributor, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- after placing on the market, not foreseen, the intended purpose modified: TRUE ("or results in a modification to the intended purpose")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as a distributor, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- foreseen or planned in the initial conformity assessment: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as a distributor, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- made before the placing on the market: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as a distributor, is the change a substantial modification` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- neither compliance nor intended purpose affected: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(23), as a distributor, is the change a substantial modification` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 3(49): serious incident`

-- Under Article 3(49), as a distributor, is the event a serious incident
-- an incident leading to death or serious harm to health: TRUE (point (a))
-- MIRROR Art 3(49): the same event asked from the provider, deployer, importer, distributor and person seats
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as a distributor, is the event a serious incident` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- an incident leading to a serious and irreversible disruption of critical infrastructure: TRUE (point (b))
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as a distributor, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- an incident leading to the infringement of fundamental rights obligations: TRUE (point (c))
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as a distributor, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- an incident leading to serious harm to property or the environment: TRUE (point (d))
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as a distributor, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
-- not an incident or malfunctioning of an AI system: FALSE (the definition says "means")
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as a distributor, is the event a serious incident` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- an incident that leads to none of the four consequences: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 3(49), as a distributor, is the event a serious incident` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS FALSE


§ `Article 111(1): components of large-scale IT systems listed in Annex X`

-- Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation
-- 31 July 2024, before entry into force: NOTHING (the Regulation did not exist)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 31 7 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS NOTHING
-- 1 August 2024, the day the Regulation enters into force, an Annex X component placed in 2020: JUST 31 December 2030 ("shall be brought into compliance with this Regulation by 31 December 2030")
-- MIRROR Art 111(1): the date for the same Annex X component, asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 1 August 2027, the day before the placement bound: placed before 2 August 2027, so JUST 31 December 2030 ("placed on the market or put into service before 2 August 2027")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1861" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 2 August 2027, the placement bound itself: NOTHING (not "before 2 August 2027")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 2 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1861" EQUALS NOTHING
-- not a component of a large-scale IT system: NOTHING (the rule reaches components of the systems listed in Annex X)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE "none" EQUALS NOTHING
-- a component of a large-scale IT system established by an act that Annex X does not list: NOTHING ("the legal acts listed in Annex X")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" EQUALS NOTHING
-- Annex X point 1(c), Regulation (EU) 2018/1862: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1862" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- Annex X point 7(b), the last act of the Annex, Regulation (EU) 2019/818: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 2 2025) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2019/818" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 26 July 2026, the text as enacted: JUST 31 December 2030 (paragraph 1 was not changed by the Omnibus)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 27 July 2026, the text as amended: JUST 31 December 2030
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)
-- 2 August 2026, the day the group General (which holds Article 111 itself) begins to apply: JUST 31 December 2030 (the date the paragraph gives does not move on that day)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, by what date must the AI system be brought into compliance with the Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" EQUALS JUST (Date 31 12 2030)

-- Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked
-- an Annex X component placed in 2020: the operator brings it into compliance on day 2343 (31 December 2030, counted from 1 August 2024): discharged
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 111(1) bring the AI system into compliance with this Regulation` AT 2343
-- the same, one day late (day 2344, 1 January 2031): BREACH
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Operator DOES `Art 111(1) bring the AI system into compliance with this Regulation` AT 2344
-- the same, the operator does nothing and time passes beyond 31 December 2030: BREACH
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2344
-- not a component of a large-scale IT system: nothing is owed, so a long wait is not a breach
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) FALSE "none" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2443
-- placed on 2 August 2027, the placement bound: nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 1 8 2024) (Date 2 8 2027) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2443
-- 31 July 2024, before the Regulation exists: nothing is owed
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `Under Article 111(1), as a distributor, what must I do to bring the AI system into compliance on the date asked` (Date 31 7 2024) (Date 1 1 2020) TRUE "Regulation (EU) 2018/1860" AT 0 WITH
    WAITUNTIL 2443


§ `Article 111(2), first sentence: is my high-risk AI system saved? (replaced by the Omnibus)`

-- Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation
-- 26 July 2026 (text as enacted), Annex III route, placed 1 August 2026, not changed: TRUE ("placed on the market or put into service before 2 August 2026, only if, as from that date, those systems are subject to significant changes in their designs")
-- MIRROR Art 111(2) first sentence: the same legacy high-risk AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 26 July 2026, placed on 2 August 2026, the date itself: FALSE (not "before 2 August 2026")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 8 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, placed 1 August 2026 and significantly changed in its design since: FALSE (the "only if" is met, so the Regulation applies)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 8 2026) TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 26 July 2026, not a high-risk AI system: FALSE ("operators of high-risk AI systems")
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 26 7 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 7 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026 (text as amended), Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027, not changed: TRUE ("before the date of application of Chapter III referred to in Article 113": 2 December 2027 for an Annex III system)
-- MIRROR Art 111(2) first sentence: the same legacy high-risk AI system asked from each operator seat
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS TRUE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex III route, placed 2 December 2027: FALSE (not before 2 December 2027)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 2 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex I route, placed 2 August 2028: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I` (Date 2 8 2028) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027 and significantly changed: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) TRUE EQUALS FALSE
-- 27 July 2026, not a high-risk AI system: FALSE
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` (Date 1 1 2026) FALSE EQUALS FALSE
-- 2 August 2026, the general date, Annex III route, placed 1 December 2027, not changed: TRUE (as amended; the saving does not stop on the day the group General begins)
#ASSERT `Under Article 111(2), as a distributor, is my high-risk AI system saved from the application of the Regulation` (Date 2 8 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (Date 1 12 2027) FALSE EQUALS TRUE


